[346.632, "o", "  \u001b[1;33m⚠\u001b[0m SSH timed out — known platform gap, not a runbook error:\r\n"]
[346.632, "o", "  \u001b[1;34mℹ\u001b[0m OVN programs the ExternalIP VIP only on the tenant UDN's load\r\n"]
[346.632, "o", "  \u001b[1;34mℹ\u001b[0m balancer; nothing on the host steers north/south traffic into the\r\n"]
[346.632, "o", "  \u001b[1;34mℹ\u001b[0m UDN, so the LoadBalancer service is unreachable from outside the\r\n"]
[346.632, "o", "  \u001b[1;34mℹ\u001b[0m cluster (and east-west from the cluster network). Needs an upstream\r\n"]
